lass=3D"_aagv"><img alt=3D"=E2=9C=A8 Majjiga Charu =E2=9C=A8

There are so many versions of seasoned or spiced yogurts in Indian cuisine.=
 Majiga charu is another seasoned yogurt dish from the Andhra cuisine.

Recipe :
=E2=80=A2 Curd - 500 ml
=E2=80=A2 Water 1 cup
=E2=80=A2 Onion - 1 chopped
=E2=80=A2 2 chillies &amp; 1/2 inch ginger crushed into paste
=E2=80=A2 Turmeric -1/2tsp
=E2=80=A2 Salt - 1tbsp

For tempering:
=E2=80=A2 Oil -1 tbsp
=E2=80=A2 mustard seeds -1/2 tsp
=E2=80=A2 Cumin seeds -1/2 tsp
=E2=80=A2 split urad dal - 1/2tsp
=E2=80=A2 Hing - 1 pinch Curry leaves
=E2=80=A2 Turmeric - 1tsp
.
.
.
