ss=3D"_aagv"><img alt=3D"=E2=9C=A8 Moong Masoor Dal =E2=9C=A8

Moong Masoor Dal is a flavorful and nutritious lentil dish made from a mix =
of moong dal (yellow split mung beans) and masoor dal (red lentils). Both o=
f these lentils are high in protein, making the dish a great source of vege=
tarian protein. The combination of these two lentils results in a soft, cre=
amy texture, and it=E2=80=99s often enjoyed with rice or flatbreads like ro=
ti.
.
.
.
