v class=3D"_aagv"><img alt=3D"=E2=9C=A8 Pyazi Malai Paneer =E2=9C=A8

Pyazi Malai Paneer is a creamy, flavorful, and rich Indian dish made with p=
aneer (Indian cottage cheese) cooked in a spiced onion gravy. The dish comb=
ines the sweetness of caramelized onions with the richness of malai (cream)=
 and the soft, succulent texture of paneer. It=E2=80=99s perfect for specia=
l occasions or a hearty meal.
.
.
.
