v class=3D"_aagu"><div class=3D"_aagv"><img alt=3D"=E2=9C=A8 Tamatar khasta=
 Poori =E2=9C=A8

Tamatar Ki Khasta Poori is a delightful, crispy, and tangy dish. It combine=
s the deliciousness of poori (deep-fried bread) with a flavour of tomato.

For the Dough:

2 cups whole wheat flour
2 tbsp semolina (suji)
1/2 tsp carom seeds (ajwain)
1/3 tsp Kalonji
1/2 tsp salt (or to taste)
Water (as needed to form the dough)
Ghee or oil (for kneading and frying)
.
.
.
